md_view_default_set_st_states_ent_sensor:
{% set st = states('[[ent:sensor:operating_state]]') %}
{% set power = states('[[ent:switch:power_switch]]') %}
{% set heat_h = is_state('[[ent:binary_sensor:heating_heater]]', 'on') %}
{% set hw_h = is_state('[[ent:binary_sensor:hotwater_heater]]', 'on') %}
{% set defrost = is_state('[[ent:binary_sensor:defrost_active]]', 'on') %}
{% if power == 'off' %}
⚪ **Heat pump is OFF** (standby). Turn on the main power switch below to resume heating or hot water.
{% elif st == 'alarm' or is_state('[[ent:binary_sensor:alarm_stop]]', 'on') %}
🔴 **Stopped due to a fault.** Open the **Diagnostics** tab to inspect the exact alarm, fix the cause, and press Reset.
{% elif defrost or st == 'defrost' %}
❄️ **Defrosting outdoor coil.** For 3–5 minutes the pump reverses heat flow to melt ice outdoors. A brief dip in radiator/floor water temperature is normal.
{% elif st == 'antilegionella' %}
🛡️ **Antilegionella disinfection active.** Heating the hot water tank to high temperature to sanitize it.
{% elif st == 'heating' %}
🔥 **Space heating active.** Delivering warm water to your home heating loop.
{% elif st == 'hot_water' %}
🚿 **Heating domestic hot water (DHW).** Charging the hot water tank.
{% elif st == 'heating_hot_water' %}
🔥🚿 **Space heating + Hot water active.**
{% elif st == 'cooling' or st == 'cooling_hot_water' %}
🧊 **Cooling active.** Chilling water for your home cooling loop.
{% elif st == 'idle' %}
🟢 **Idle — target temperature reached.** Resting until water cools down by the configured hysteresis.
{% elif is_state('[[ent:binary_sensor:compressor_running]]', 'on') %}
🔥 **Compressor is running** (enable *Derived Sensors* in integration options for a detailed state summary).
{% else %}
🟢 **Heat pump is ON (standby).**
{% endif %}
{% if heat_h or hw_h %}
⚠️ **Notice:** Auxiliary electric backup heater is active (1:1 resistive heat — higher electricity use).
{% endif %}

md_view_diagnostics_set_errors_ent_binar:
{% set errors = [
  '[[ent:binary_sensor:error_hotwater_sensor]]',
  '[[ent:binary_sensor:error_ambient_sensor]]',
  '[[ent:binary_sensor:error_coil_sensor]]',
  '[[ent:binary_sensor:error_outlet_sensor]]',
  '[[ent:binary_sensor:error_high_pressure_sensor]]',
  '[[ent:binary_sensor:error_phase_sequence]]',
  '[[ent:binary_sensor:error_water_flow]]',
  '[[ent:binary_sensor:error_high_temp_heating]]',
  '[[ent:binary_sensor:error_outlet_gas_temp]]',
  '[[ent:binary_sensor:error_inlet_sensor]]',
  '[[ent:binary_sensor:error_exhaust_high]]',
  '[[ent:binary_sensor:error_low_temp_cooling]]',
  '[[ent:binary_sensor:error_inlet_gas_sensor]]',
  '[[ent:binary_sensor:error_low_pressure]]',
  '[[ent:binary_sensor:error_high_pressure]]',
  '[[ent:binary_sensor:error_coil_temp_high]]',
  '[[ent:binary_sensor:error_high_pressure_sensor2]]',
  '[[ent:binary_sensor:error_low_pressure_sensor]]',
  '[[ent:binary_sensor:error_antifreeze_secondary]]',
  '[[ent:binary_sensor:error_antifreeze_primary]]',
  '[[ent:binary_sensor:error_ambient_temp_low]]',
  '[[ent:binary_sensor:error_inverter_module]]',
  '[[ent:binary_sensor:error_dc_fan2]]',
  '[[ent:binary_sensor:error_dc_fan1]]'
] %}
{% set active = namespace(items=[]) %}
{% for e in errors %}
  {% if is_state(e, 'on') %}
    {% set active.items = active.items + [state_attr(e, 'friendly_name') or e] %}
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if is_state('[[ent:binary_sensor:alarm_stop]]', 'on') or active.items | length > 0 %}
🔴 **FAULT DETECTED! Active errors ({{ active.items | length }}):**
{% for item in active.items %}
- ⚠️ {{ item }}
{% endfor %}
**What to check before resetting:**
- *Water Flow Error:* clean the Y-strainer, bleed air, check closed radiator valves.
- *High Pressure:* verify water circulation and heat exchanger cleanliness.
- *Low Pressure / Antifreeze:* inspect outdoor coil icing and refrigerant charge.
{% else %}
🟢 **No active alarms (0 / 24 faults).** All sensors and safety switches are healthy.
{% endif %}

md_view_optimization_set_cycle_states_en:
{% set cycle = states('[[ent:sensor:compressor_last_run_duration]]') %}
{% set prev_cycle = state_attr('[[ent:sensor:compressor_last_run_duration]]', 'last_completed_minutes') %}
{% set comp_on = is_state('[[ent:binary_sensor:compressor_running]]', 'on') %}
{% set def_dur = states('[[ent:sensor:defrost_last_duration]]') %}
{% set def_int = states('[[ent:sensor:defrost_last_interval]]') %}
{% set coil_d = states('[[ent:sensor:coil_ambient_delta]]') %}
{% set water_d = states('[[ent:sensor:water_delta_t]]') %}
{% set eco_d = states('[[ent:sensor:eco_setpoint_delta]]') %}
{% set op = states('[[ent:sensor:operating_state]]') %}
{% set defrost = is_state('[[ent:binary_sensor:defrost_active]]', 'on') or op == 'defrost' %}
{% set heating_run = op in ['heating', 'hot_water', 'heating_hot_water'] %}
{% set hz = states('[[ent:sensor:compressor_frequency]]') | float(0) %}
{% set heat_h = is_state('[[ent:binary_sensor:heating_heater]]', 'on') %}
{% set hw_h = is_state('[[ent:binary_sensor:hotwater_heater]]', 'on') %}
{% set ch_h = is_state('[[ent:binary_sensor:chassis_heater]]', 'on') %}
**Live check based on current readings:**
{% if comp_on %}
{% if is_number(prev_cycle) and prev_cycle | float > 0 %}
{% if prev_cycle | float < 15 %}
- 🟡 **Short previous compressor cycle ({{ prev_cycle }} min; current run: {{ cycle }} min):** If not finishing DHW, the unit may be short-cycling. Raise *Heating Hysteresis (P03)* by 1°C or increase *G03*.
{% else %}
- 🟢 **Previous compressor cycle ({{ prev_cycle }} min; current run: {{ cycle }} min):** Long, steady runs with minimal startup loss.
{% endif %}
{% elif is_number(cycle) %}
- 🔄 **Compressor cycle in progress ({{ cycle }} min):** Short-cycling evaluation will appear after the first completed cycle.
{% endif %}
{% elif is_number(prev_cycle) and prev_cycle | float > 0 %}
{% if prev_cycle | float < 15 %}
- 🟡 **Short compressor cycle ({{ prev_cycle }} min):** If not finishing DHW, the unit may be short-cycling. Raise *Heating Hysteresis (P03)* by 1°C or increase *G03*.
{% else %}
- 🟢 **Compressor cycle duration ({{ prev_cycle }} min):** Long, steady runs with minimal startup loss.
{% endif %}
{% elif is_number(cycle) and cycle | float > 0 %}
{% if cycle | float < 15 %}
- 🟡 **Short compressor cycle ({{ cycle }} min):** If not finishing DHW, the unit may be short-cycling. Raise *Heating Hysteresis (P03)* by 1°C or increase *G03*.
{% else %}
- 🟢 **Compressor cycle duration ({{ cycle }} min):** Long, steady runs with minimal startup loss.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% if defrost %}
- ❄️ **Defrost active:** The unit reversed its refrigeration cycle and temporarily draws heat from water (`Water Delta T` goes negative — normal). Flow checks resume once heating restarts.
{% elif is_number(water_d) and hz > 0 and heating_run %}
{% if water_d | float < 0 %}
- 🔄 **Post-defrost / startup stabilization (Delta T {{ water_d }} °C):** Chilled water from defrost is still passing through the plate heat exchanger.
{% elif water_d | float < 2.0 %}
- 🟡 **Low Water Delta T ({{ water_d }} °C):** Circulation pump is moving water very fast or heat isn't absorbed. Check *G04 (Target Delta T)* and DC pump speed.
{% elif water_d | float > 7.5 %}
- 🟡 **High Water Delta T ({{ water_d }} °C):** Restricted flow — clean your Y-strainer or raise circulation flow to protect COP.
{% else %}
- 🟢 **Water Delta T ({{ water_d }} °C):** Balanced heat exchange.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% if heat_h or hw_h %}
- 🔴 **Electric Backup Heater ON (COP = 1.0)!** Lower *G05/G07* (e.g. to -12°C) and raise delay *G06/G08* to 45–60 min.
{% else %}
- 🟢 **Backup heaters OFF:** All heat is produced efficiently by the compressor.
{% endif %}
{% if ch_h %}
- ℹ️ **Chassis tray heater ON:** Draws ~43 W continuously to keep drain ice-free.
{% endif %}
{% if is_number(eco_d) %}
- 📊 **Supply vs ECO Curve:** offset is **{{ eco_d }} °C** (every 1°C lower heating water saves ~2–3% electricity).
{% endif %}
{% if is_number(coil_d) %}
- ❄️ **Frost buildup (Outdoor - Coil):** **{{ coil_d }} °C** (0 °C = clean coil / defrost; rising toward 8–10 °C means frost is thickening).
{% endif %}
{% if is_number(def_dur) and def_dur | float > 0 %}
- ⏱️ **Last defrost:** took **{{ def_dur }} min**{% if is_number(def_int) and def_int | float > 0 %}, interval since prior defrost: **{{ def_int }} min**{% endif %}. Healthy defrosts take 3–5 min.
{% endif %}
